<figure class="karta-fan"><span class="foto"><img alt="Cream roses and peach carnations with eucalyptus in pearly paper with a ribbon" decoding="async" height="1350" loading="lazy" src="{{ A }}img/V08-kvetiny-fan-5.webp" width="900"/></span><figcaption><span class="co">Cream</span><span class="veta">Roses and carnations with eucalyptus.</span></figcaption></figure>
