<section class="pz-ext" id="proc"><div class="pz-obal">
<h2>Why us</h2><p class="pz-uvod">We arrange every bouquet for a particular person and a particular moment. Just tell us who it is for.</p><div class="pz-tri"><div><h3>Help with choosing</h3><p>You don’t need to know flower names. Tell us who the bouquet is for and the mood you want, and we’ll choose together.</p></div><div><h3>Fresh and seasonal</h3><p>We work with what is fresh right now. If something is missing, we replace it with a flower in the same tone.</p></div><div><h3>Ready when you need it</h3><p>We prepare the bouquet for the day and time you agree with us, so you just pick it up.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="pz-ext" id="kontakt-formular"><div class="pz-obal pz-dva">
<div><h2>Contact and orders</h2><p class="pz-uvod">Tell us who the bouquet is for, when you need it and your budget. We’ll get back to you to sort out the details.</p>
<dl>{% if address %}<dt>Address</dt><dd>{{ address }}{% if maps_url %} · <a href="{{ maps_url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">map</a>{% endif %}</dd>{% endif %}
{% if phone %}<dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:{{ phone_href }}">{{ phone }}</a></dd>{% endif %}
{% if email %}<dt>E-mail</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ email }}">{{ email }}</a></dd>{% endif %}</dl>
{% if hours %}<div aria-label="Opening hours" class="pz-hod-t">{{ hours_rows|safe }}</div>{% endif %}</div>
<form class="pz-form" data-formular="dotaz" novalidate="">
<label for="pz-j">Full name<input autocomplete="name" id="pz-j" name="jmeno" required=""/></label>
<label for="pz-t">Phone<input autocomplete="tel" id="pz-t" name="telefon" type="tel"/></label>
<label for="pz-e">E-mail<input autocomplete="email" id="pz-e" name="email" required="" type="email"/></label>
<label for="pz-z">What do you have in mind<textarea id="pz-z" name="zprava" required=""></textarea></label>
<button type="submit">Send</button><p aria-live="polite" class="pz-ok" role="status"></p></form>
<script>(function(){var f=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();var bad=null;
f.querySelectorAll('[required]').forEach(function(el){var ok=el.value.trim()&&(el.type!=='email'||/^[^@\s]+@[^@\s]+\.[^@\s]+$/.test(el.value));el.setAttribute('aria-invalid',ok?'false':'true');if(!ok&&!bad)bad=el;});
var m=f.querySelector('.pz-ok');if(bad){m.textContent='Please fill in the highlighted fields.';bad.focus();return;}m.textContent='Thank you, we’ll get back to you soon.';setTimeout(function(){f.reset();},50);});})();</script>
</div></section>
<section class="pz-ext" id="rady"><div class="pz-obal"><h2>Florist’s tips</h2><p class="pz-uvod">A few tips to make your flowers last and bring joy.</p><details><summary>How to make cut flowers last longer</summary><p>Cut the stems at an angle with a sharp knife and put them straight into a clean vase with lukewarm water. Remove any leaves that would sit below the waterline – they rot and shorten the life of the whole bouquet.</p><p>Change the water every day or two and rinse the vase each time. Keep the bouquet away from radiators, direct sunlight and fruit bowls – ripening fruit releases ethylene, which makes flowers wilt faster.</p></details><details><summary>Choosing a bouquet for a birthday or anniversary</summary><p>Start with the person, not the flowers: what colours do they wear, what is their home like, do they prefer bold or delicate things? That helps a florist more than an exact flower name.</p><p>A short note on a card goes well with any bouquet. If you are giving it in the evening, let us know – we’ll pick flowers that travel well.</p></details><details><summary>Houseplants by light</summary><p>Darker spots suit plants that tolerate partial shade, such as ZZ plant, snake plant or pothos. South-facing windows are best for succulents and sun-loving plants.</p><p>The most common mistake is overwatering. Water only when the top layer of soil is dry and empty any water left in the saucer.</p></details></div></section>{# SEKCE_PATCH_V1 #}{% include "_onas.html.j2" %}
<section class="pz-mapa-sec" style="padding:0 0 clamp(40px,6vw,80px)">{% include "_mapa.html.j2" %}</section>
<section aria-labelledby="hod-h" class="hodnoceni" data-hodnoceni="" hidden="">
<div class="hod-souhrn">
<h2 id="hod-h">What people say</h2>
<div class="hod-cislo">
<span class="znamka" data-hod-znamka=""></span>
